# 🫁 Predictive Modeling for Lung Cancer Detection Using Machine Learning

> Unveiling Insights through Machine Learning Techniques

**Authors:** Nida Aijaz Zargar & Anil Barnwal
**Affiliation:** Amity Institute of Biotechnology, Amity University, Noida, India
