## 📈 Results

| Model | AUC | Accuracy | Precision | Recall | F-Measure |
|-------|-----|----------|-----------|--------|-----------|
| **Random Forest** | **0.9919** | **0.9880** | **0.9880** | **0.9880** | **0.9880** |
| XGBoost | 0.9881 | 0.9760 | 0.9770 | 0.9760 | 0.9760 |
| Logistic Regression | 0.9777 | 0.9281 | 0.9300 | 0.9280 | 0.9280 |
| Decision Tree | 0.9584 | 0.9581 | 0.9590 | 0.9580 | 0.9580 |
| Gradient Boosting | 0.9850 | 0.9760 | 0.9770 | 0.9760 | 0.9760 |
| MLP | 0.9750 | 0.9521 | 0.9530 | 0.9520 | 0.9520 |
| SVC | 0.9700 | 0.9401 | 0.9410 | 0.9400 | 0.9400 |
| KNN | 0.9600 | 0.9341 | 0.9350 | 0.9340 | 0.9340 |
| Gaussian NB | 0.9500 | 0.9100 | 0.9120 | 0.9100 | 0.9100 |
